    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A procedurally generated action-platformer where the challenge never ends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped from a dark swirling portal, you awaken in an unfamiliar forest with a jumbled memory\u2014only to find yourself thrust into a battle against the forces of darkness. Guided by a mysterious old man, your journey leads to the <strong>demon lord\u2019s castle</strong>, where the truth behind your arrival awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Progression, Infinite Challenge</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong>, each packed with enemies and a <strong>rewarding loot chest</strong> at the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer <strong>the demon lord</strong>\u00a0and prove your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory <strong>raises the game\u2019s level</strong>, making enemies <strong>tougher</strong> and loot <strong>stronger</strong>\u2014how far can you go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize, Collect, Conquer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>34 collectible equipment items</strong> to enhance your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your <strong>character\u2019s look</strong> with <strong>customization and vanity slots</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With difficulty that <strong>scales infinitely</strong>, <i>For Eternity</i> offers a <strong>true test of endurance and skill</strong>. Every run is a chance to <strong>push further</strong>, <strong>discover new gear</strong>, and ultimately <strong>face the demon lord</strong> in a battle beyond time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A procedurally generated action-platformer where the challenge never ends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped from a dark swirling portal, you awaken in an unfamiliar forest with a jumbled memory\u2014only to find yourself thrust into a battle against the forces of darkness. Guided by a mysterious old man, your journey leads to the <strong>demon lord\u2019s castle</strong>, where the truth behind your arrival awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Progression, Infinite Challenge</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong>, each packed with enemies and a <strong>rewarding loot chest</strong> at the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer <strong>the demon lord</strong>\u00a0and prove your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory <strong>raises the game\u2019s level</strong>, making enemies <strong>tougher</strong> and loot <strong>stronger</strong>\u2014how far can you go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize, Collect, Conquer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>34 collectible equipment items</strong> to enhance your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your <strong>character\u2019s look</strong> with <strong>customization and vanity slots</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With difficulty that <strong>scales infinitely</strong>, <i>For Eternity</i> offers a <strong>true test of endurance and skill</strong>. Every run is a chance to <strong>push further</strong>, <strong>discover new gear</strong>, and ultimately <strong>face the demon lord</strong> in a battle beyond time.</p>",
